      "q": "How much does Palantir Usg make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Palantir Usg has $1.2B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Palantir Usg recorded 50 awards for the period with an average award size of $23.7M, and obligations are up 59.2% year over year."
