    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Palantir Usg?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense, the Department of State, the National Aeronautics and Space Administration, and the U.S. International Development Finance Corporation buy from Palantir Usg. The Department of Defense obligated $1.1B in FY2026 to date, followed by the Department of State with $18M and NASA with $12.1M."
